      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Contract rules (show interfaces, not just hashes)\n\n1. list_seat \u2192 encumbrance=LISTED \u00b7 epoch FREEZE \u00b7 request_raw_sign refused\n2. buy_seat(token_id, sync_nonce) \u2192 ownership flip \u00b7 pending status=REBOUND_TO_BUYER\n3. withdraw by old owner \u2192 assert current owner \u00b7 refuse\n4. Diligence: 6 named checks; wash flag alone \u2192 FIX BEFORE BUY (demo fail path)",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Contract rules (show interfaces, not just hashes)\n\n1. list_seat \u2192 encumbrance=LISTED \u00b7 epoch FREEZE \u00b7 request_raw_sign refused\n2. buy_seat(token_id, sync_nonce) \u2192 ownership flip \u00b7 pending status=REBOUND_TO_BUYER\n3. withdraw by old owner \u2192 assert current owner \u00b7 refuse\n4. Diligence: 6 named checks; wash flag alone \u2192 FIX BEFORE BUY (demo fail path)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 14
    },
